    "reviews": "\u201cWhat follows is a puzzle-y platformer that takes cues from Trials, Team 17 and the works of Bennett Foddy. It has the humour of Overcooked and the gameplay of Qwop.\u201d<br>The Indie Game Website<br><br>\u201cIf loving a game where you have to bounce and rocket-blast a giant donut through ever-increasing obstacle courses all in the name of saving a sentient cup of coffee is wrong, then I don't want to be right.  Thank God I've embraced the wrongness on this one!\u201d<br>Destructoid<br>",
